00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.600
This sound winds upwards from an ancient decrepit village.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.277
It's a village hidden by the mists.

00:00:38.277 --> 00:00:40.080
Mists that coil in a forest.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:46.840
A forest deep below the earth. Only the devoted or the exiled can find it now.

